  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **For Granted**: with Karl Denson & Cochemea Gastelum [2]\n- **Too Much**: with Nigel Hall [2]\n- **If You Want Me to Stay**: with Ivan Neville & Nigel Hall [2]\n- **Tuesday Night's Squad (continued)**: with Nigel Hall [2]\n- **Licking Stick**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **There Was A Time**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances; with Nigel Hall [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2009-04-30** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 106 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Ivan Neville & Nigel Hall, Karl Denson & Cochemea Gastelum, Nigel Hall [1]\n- Show was the 2nd Royal Family Ball at Howlin' Wolf; Ivan Neville joined on keyboards and vocals [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2009-04-30**: taped by CosmicSoul420; transferred by CosmicSoul420; source: Schoeps MK41V>CMC6>UNL2>HDP2 48/24 FOB DFC @ 8ft [1]. Also: Recorded and transferred by Steve S.; chain was Schoeps MK41V microphones, CMC6, UNL2, then HDP2, at 48kHz/24-bit; Taped front of board-area position, DFC pattern, with microphones placed about eight feet away [1]",
